rner.in/#website\",\"name\":\"9th Corner\",\"alternateName\":\"Ninth Corner\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"}}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What does an interior designer for office projects in Chhattarpur do?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We plan workstations, cabins, meeting rooms, reception, pantry and storage around how your team works. Lighting, acoustics, cabling and air-conditioning are planned with the layout, not added later.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can you design a small office or a single floor?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. We design small offices and single floors as well as larger workspaces. In a small office, smart storage and multi-use meeting areas make the biggest difference.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Why hire a designer instead of buying ready furniture?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"An interior designer for office space plans movement, privacy, light and future growth, so the office stays comfortable and does not need to be redone when the team grows.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can the office reflect our brand?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Colours, reception design, wall graphics and materials can follow your brand, so clients and staff get a clear sense of the company when they walk in.\"}}]}","{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Interior Designer for Office in Chhattarpur, Delhi\",\"serviceType\":\"Interior Designer for Office\",\"description\":\"Need an interior designer for office in Chhattarpur? 9th Corner designs workstations, cabins, meeting rooms and receptions that suit your team.\",\"url\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/chhattarpur/services-interior-designer-for-office\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://www.ninthcorner.in/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Chhattarpur, Delhi\"}}"],"preloads":[],"html":"<!-- CITY-EXPANSION -->\n    <style>\n        /* New Warm & Elegant Theme Colors */\n        :root {\n            --bg-color: #f4f1ee; /* Warm Off-White */\n            --text-color: #5a5349; /* Warm Gray/Brown Body Text */\n            --heading-color: #4a433a; /* Darker Warm Gray/Brown Headings */\n            --accent-color: #8b8173; /* Muted Khaki/Taupe Accent */\n            --font-serif: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;\n            --font-sans: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n            /* Existing non-color variables kept for structure */\n            --shadow-subtle: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n            --border-radius: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* General Styles */\n        body {\n            font-family: var(--font-sans);\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .container {\n            width: 100%;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n        h1, h2, h3 {\n            font-family: var(--font-serif);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            line-height: 1.1;\n            margin-top: 0;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        p {\n            font-weight: 400;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        b, strong {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        section {\n            padding: 60px 0;\n        }\n        \n        /* --- Hero Section --- */\n        .hero-section {\n            background-image: url('/img/e1.avif'); \n            background-size: cover;\n            background-position: center center;\n            position: relative; \n            overflow: hidden;\n            min-height: 400px;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            padding: 80px 20px 60px;\n            border-bottom-left-radius: 40px;\n            border-bottom-right-radius: 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section::before {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            right: 0;\n            bottom: 0;\n            background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n        \n        .hero-section .container {\n            position: relative;\n            z-index: 3;\n        }\n\n        .hero-section h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(30px, 5.5vw, 54px);\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            color: var(--bg-color);\n            text-shadow: none;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Content & Philosophy --- */\n        .content-wrap {\n            padding: 40px 0;\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .intro-text, .philosophy-box {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .intro-text h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            line-height: 1.25;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box {\n            background-color: var(--bg-color);\n            border: 2px solid var(--accent-color);\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p {\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Services Grid --- */\n        .services-grid {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            gap: 30px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .service-card.full-width,\n        .service-card:nth-child(3),\n        .service-card:nth-child(4) {\n            grid-column: 1 / -1;\n        }\n        .service-card {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 30px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;\n        }\n        .service-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-5px);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n        }\n        .service-card h3 {\n            font-size: 24px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .service-card p {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .service-card p:last-child {\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n        }\n        .service-card ul {\n            padding-left: 20px;\n            margin: 10px 0;\n        }\n        .service-card li {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Why Choose Us --- */\n        .why-choose-us {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .why-choose-us h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro {\n            text-align: center;\n            max-width: 800px;\n            margin: 0 auto 30px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n        .why-choose-intro p {\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .reason-list {\n            list-style: none;\n            padding: 0;\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));\n            gap: 20px;\n        }\n        .reason-list li {\n            background: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            border-left: 5px solid var(--accent-color);\n            font-size: 15px;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n        }\n        .reason-list strong {\n            display: block;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .final-cta-message {\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-style: italic;\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .final-cta-message a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            text-decoration: underline;\n            font-weight: 600;\n        }\n\n        /* --- FAQ Section --- */\n        .faq-section {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n        }\n        .faq-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .faq-list {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n        .faq-item {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 20px;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .faq-q {\n            font-size: 18px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n            margin-bottom: 10px;\n        }\n        .faq-a {\n            font-size: 15px;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Learn More Button */\n        .learn-more-wrap {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-top: 35px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: var(--accent-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            font-weight: 600;\n            padding: 14px 38px;\n            border-radius: 30px;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            transition: all 0.3s ease;\n            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.3);\n            letter-spacing: 0.5px;\n        }\n        .learn-more-btn:hover {\n            background-color: var(--heading-color);\n            color: #ffffff;\n            transform: translateY(-2px);\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(74, 67, 58, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        /* --- Closing Section --- */\n        .closing-section {\n            padding: 40px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid #eee;\n            margin-top: 30px;\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n        .closing-section h2 {\n            font-size: 32px;\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n        .closing-section p {\n            max-width: 900px;\n            margin: 0 auto 15px;\n            font-size: 16px;\n            line-height: 1.7;\n        }\n        .closing-section p a {\n            color: var(--accent-color);\n            font-weight: 600;\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        /* --- Work Done / Project Showcase Gallery Carousel --- */\n        .work-gallery-section {\n            margin-top: 50px;\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        .gallery-header {\n            text-align: center;\n            margin-bottom: 35px;\n            padding: 0 20px;\n        }\n        .gallery-header h2 {\n            font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 36px);\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            color: var(--heading-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-header p {\n            font-size: 16px;\n            max-width: 750px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            color: var(--text-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n            width: 100%;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            padding: 15px 0 25px;\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 4%, black 96%, transparent);\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-track {\n            display: flex;\n            width: max-content;\n            animation: infiniteGalleryScroll 30s linear infinite;\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:hover .gallery-carousel-track,\n        .gallery-carousel-wrapper:active .gallery-carousel-track {\n            animation-play-state: paused;\n        }\n        .gallery-carousel-group {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 25px;\n            padding-right: 25px;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card {\n            width: 320px;\n            max-width: 340px;\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border-radius: var(--border-radius);\n            overflow: hidden;\n            box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(139, 129, 115, 0.2);\n            transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease, border-color 0.35s ease;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            flex-shrink: 0;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-8px);\n            box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);\n            border-color: var(--accent-color);\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 240px;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            position: relative;\n            background-color: #e5e0d8;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n        }\n        .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            object-fit: cover;\n            display: block;\n            transition: transform 0.6s ease;\n        }\n        .gallery-card:hover .gallery-img-wrap img {\n            transform: scale(1.08);\n        }\n        @keyframes infiniteGalleryScroll {\n            0% {\n                transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);\n            }\n            100% {\n                transform: translate3d(-25%, 0, 0);\n            }\n        }\n        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation: none;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-wrapper {\n                overflow-x: auto;\n                -webkit-mask-image: none;\n                mask-image: none;\n            }\n        }        /* Mobile Responsiveness */\n        @media (max-width: 767px) {\n            .hero-section {\n                padding: 60px 16px 40px;\n                border-radius: 0;\n            }\n            .content-wrap.container {\n                padding-left: 0;\n                padding-right: 0;\n                padding-top: 25px;\n                padding-bottom: 25px;\n            }\n            .intro-text {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 35px;\n            }\n            .intro-text h2 {\n                font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 6.5vw, 2.1rem);\n                line-height: 1.22;\n                margin-bottom: 16px;\n            }\n            .intro-text p {\n                font-size: 16px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                margin-bottom: 15px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                max-width: 100%;\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                padding: 26px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                overflow: hidden;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box h2 {\n                margin: 0 0 22px;\n                text-align: center;\n                font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 7vw, 2.25rem);\n                line-height: 1.18;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p {\n                width: 100%;\n                margin: 0 0 20px;\n                padding: 0;\n                text-align: left;\n                text-indent: 0;\n                font-size: 17px;\n                line-height: 1.7;\n                overflow-wrap: break-word;\n                word-break: normal;\n                hyphens: none;\n            }\n            .philosophy-box p:last-child {\n                margin-bottom: 0;\n            }\n            .services-grid {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n                gap: 20px;\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                margin-bottom: 40px;\n            }\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n            }\n            .gallery-card {\n                width: 280px;\n            }\n            .gallery-img-wrap {\n                height: 200px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-group {\n                gap: 18px;\n                padding-right: 18px;\n            }\n            .gallery-carousel-track {\n                animation-duration: 22s;\n            }\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 32px);\n                margin-left: auto;\n                margin-right: auto;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n                padding: 25px 16px;\n                border-radius: 16px;\n            }\n            .process-card-row {\n                flex-direction: column;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 767px) {\n            .intro-text,\n            .philosophy-box,\n            .services-grid,\n            .why-choose-us,\n            .faq-section,\n            .closing-section {\n                width: calc(100% - 40px);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n\n    <!-- HERO SECTION -->\n    <section class=\"hero-section\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h1>Interior Designer for Office in Chhattarpur, Delhi</h1>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- MAIN CONTENT WRAPPER -->\n    <div class=\"container content-wrap\">\n\n        <!-- INTRO -->\n        <div class=\"intro-text\">\n            <h2>Offices for Growing Businesses in Chhattarpur</h2>\n            <p>As an interior designer for office spaces in Chhattarpur, Delhi, we design offices that enhance efficiency, reflect your brand, and provide ultimate comfort. From corporate headquarters to collaborative co-working spaces, we create professional, functional, and visually appealing work environments that empower your team and support your business goals.</p>\n            <p>Chhattarpur is home to many owner-run businesses: property dealers, event planners, caterers, transport firms, coaching centres and small export houses. Each needs an office that looks credible to clients and works for the team. As an interior designer for office spaces, we plan for both, often within a modest floor area.</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- PHILOSOPHY / SERVICE OVERVIEW -->\n        <div class=\"philosophy-box\">\n            <h2>Smart and Functional Office Interiors</h2>\n            <p>\"Our designs focus on ergonomic layouts, modern furniture, smart lighting, and brand-aligned interiors. Each office is tailored to improve workflow, foster creativity, and impress clients and employees alike, ensuring your physical space becomes a strategic asset for growth.\"</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- SERVICE CATEGORIES GRID (4 CARDS) -->\n        <div class=\"services-grid\">\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Owner-Run Business Offices</h3>\n                <p>In a family business, the owner's cabin, a meeting space and a records room usually matter more than a large open floor. We plan a front office that impresses visitors, a quiet cabin with storage for files and a work area for staff that is easy to supervise.</p><p>A small pantry and a clean washroom make a big difference to daily comfort.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card\">\n                <h3>Offices Inside Homes and Farmhouses</h3>\n                <p>Many owners run their work from an office on the ground floor of the house or inside the farmhouse. An interior designer for office space at home keeps it separate from family areas with its own entry, soundproofing and storage, so clients can visit without walking through the living room.</p><p>We also design reception counters and waiting seats that suit the kind of visitors you get, whether walk-in customers or corporate clients.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>Comfort for Long Working Hours</h3>\n                <p>Chairs with proper back support, desks at the right height and screens placed away from window glare reduce fatigue. Good ventilation and steady cooling matter in summer, especially on upper floors. We also plan enough power and data points so that cables do not run across the floor.</p><p>A display wall for licences, awards or project photos helps build trust with visitors.</p><p><b>Productivity Layouts:</b> Strategically optimized office layouts designed to minimize distractions and maximize daily operational efficiency.</p><p><b>Ergonomic Focus:</b> Integrating ergonomic furniture and customized lighting solutions to ensure employee health, comfort, and sustained focus.</p><p><b>Brand Integration:</b> Translating your company's values and brand identity into physical design elements that leave a lasting impression on clients.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"service-card full-width\">\n                <h3>How We Set Up Your Office</h3>\n                <p>We start by understanding your business, team size and how clients visit. The interior designer for office projects on our team then prepares a layout and 3D views, along with a clear cost estimate.</p><p>Our site team builds partitions, ceilings, electricals, networking and furniture, and we plan the work so your business can keep running during the fit-out wherever possible.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->\n        <section class=\"why-choose-us\">\n            <h2>Why Choose Us as an Interior Designer for Office Spaces in Chhattarpur</h2>\n            <div class=\"why-choose-intro\">\n                <p>Small and medium businesses need value for money. We focus spending on the areas clients see and the furniture staff use every day.</p>\n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"reason-list\">\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Experienced in Corporate & Commercial Interiors</strong>\n                    Offices for traders, agencies, clinics and firms.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Customized Solutions for Modern Workspaces</strong>\n                    Plans that match how your business actually runs.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Complete End-to-End Project Management</strong>\n                    Turnkey delivery with a fixed move-in date.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Home Offices Done Right</strong>\n                    Separate entry, quiet rooms and proper storage.\n                </li>\n                <li>\n                    <strong>Spending Where It Counts</strong>\n                    Budget focused on clients and daily use.\n                </li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"final-cta-message\">\n                <p>Ready to transform your workspace into a hub of innovation? Partner with the leading interior designer for office projects in Chhattarpur, Delhi today.</p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- WORK DONE / PORTFOLIO SHOWCASE -->\n        <section class=\"work-gallery-section\">\n            <div class=\"gallery-header\">\n                <h2>Our Completed Projects Near Chhattarpur</h2>\n                <p>Projects by our team in Gurgaon, Green Park and Saket, near Chhattarpur.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"gallery-carousel-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"gallery-carousel-track\">\n                    <div class=\"gallery-carousel-group\">\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-sachin-saket/mr-sachin-saket/28.avif\" alt=\"Apartment design in Saket, Delhi by 9th Corner\" title=\"Saket Apartment\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-virend-singh-gu