rner in Gurgaon\" title=\"Gurgaon Residence\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"gallery-card\">\n                            <div class=\"gallery-img-wrap\">\n                                <img width=\"800\" height=\"550\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/project/mr-rao-green-park/mr-rao-green-park/23.avif\" alt=\"Interior design project in Green Park, Delhi by 9th Corner\" title=\"Green Park Interior\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- FAQS:auto -->\n        <section class=\"faq-section\">\n            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <div class=\"faq-list\">\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">What does an interior designer for office projects in Chhattarpur do?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">We plan workstations, cabins, meeting rooms, reception, pantry and storage around how your team works. Lighting, acoustics, cabling and air-conditioning are planned with the layout, not added later.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Can you design a small office or a single floor?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. We design small offices and single floors as well as larger workspaces. In a small office, smart storage and multi-use meeting areas make the biggest difference.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Why hire a designer instead of buying ready furniture?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">An interior designer for office space plans movement, privacy, light and future growth, so the office stays comfortable and does not need to be redone when the team grows.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-item\">\n                    <h3 class=\"faq-q\">Can the office reflect our brand?</h3>\n                    <p class=\"faq-a\">Yes. Colours, reception design, wall graphics and materials can follow your brand, so clients and staff get a clear sense of the company when they walk in.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <!-- /FAQS:auto -->\n\n        <!-- CLOSING SECTION -->\n        <div class=\"closing-section\">\n            <h2>An Office That Works as Hard as You Do</h2>\n            <p>The right workspace saves time every day and makes a strong first impression. A practical interior designer for office projects makes that possible within your budget.</p><p>Setting up an office in Chhattarpur? <a href=\"/chhattarpur/contact\">Talk to 9th Corner</a> about your space.</p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n"}